  {
    title: 'Tilt one line with its weight',
    narration: 'Sweeping w₁ of the selected neuron rotates its line about the origin; the half-plane it labels positive rotates with it, and the two lines now cut the plane into four differently shaped regions.',
    dim: 2, w: -2, b: 0
  },
  {
    title: '3D: the hyperplane is a plane',
